      "value": "Repository fiducia-ventures/anna-university-question-paper-generation -\u003e Settings -\u003e Secrets and variables -\u003e Actions -\u003e Variables:\n  AWS_REGION        = ap-south-2\n  TF_STATE_BUCKET   = qpgen-tfstate-850995535715\n  AWS_PLAN_ROLE_ARN = arn:aws:iam::850995535715:role/qpgen-github-plan\n  ALERT_EMAIL       = (address that receives alarm notifications)\nSettings -\u003e Environments: create dev, prod; in each, add the variable\nAWS_APPLY_ROLE_ARN (see apply_role_arns). Add required reviewers to prod.\n",
